<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/doi-10-1162-imag-a-00032> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:rfddbccaa77e19bdbb20eae14_n24602f2efa0e49a2a6c2358c82b52badb7 .
