_:r2836a791b1d923c06464510c_n5244246231c04cdabcc825a76a564fd6b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Advanced Image Processing in Magnetic Resonance Imaging: fMRI, MRI, EEG, MEG" .
_:r2836a791b1d923c06464510c_n5244246231c04cdabcc825a76a564fd6b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> .
