_:r9b989a77e3fb00ec1cfb9208_nc011c9db26b249acb1c6c7b000bd4c87b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
